        "description": {
            "value": "<p>You reach up to the stars and create a temporary portal that allows a blast of plasma to pass through the battlefield. The plasma deals electricity and fire damage with a basic Reflex save. The number of actions you spend when Casting this Spell determines the area and other parameters.</p>\n<p><span class=\"action-glyph\">1</span> This spell is a @Template[type:cone|distance:15], dealing @Damage[2d6[electricity]|options:area-damage] damage and @Damage[2d6[fire]|options:area-damage] damage.</p>\n<p><span class=\"action-glyph\">2</span>This spell is a @Template[type:cone|distance:30], dealing @Damage[5d6[electricity]|options:area-damage] damage and @Damage[5d6[fire]|options:area-damage] damage.</p>\n<p><span class=\"action-glyph\">3</span> This spell is a @Template[type:cone|distance:60], dealing @Damage[5d6[electricity]|options:area-damage] damage and @Damage[5d6[fire]|options:area-damage] damage. Creatures that fail their saves become @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Sickened]{Sickened 1} (@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Sickened]{Sickened 2} on a critical failure) due to their exposure to cosmic radiation.</p><hr /><p><strong>Heightened (+2)</strong> The damage increases by 1d6 for each damage type with the 1-action version, or by 2d6 for each damage type for the 2- and 3-action versions.</p>"
        },
